### 0e. [2026-02-24 18:57] Rate-limit retry
add a stay and pause when claude is running out of token, that the script should wait and try until the time limit has past. keep retrying for every 30 mins, printing something during the retry. it should automatically resume when the token is back to normal usage.

### 0f. [2026-02-25 12:53] Work-hours pause
